<reference id="bacnet-BacnetNetwork" xml:lang="en" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">BacnetNetwork (bacnet-BacnetNetwork)</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component is the base container for all BACnet components
(devices and proxy points). If added to the station, it resides under
the station’s <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol> container. Its default
view is the <wintitle class="+ topic/keyword ui-d/wintitle ">Bacnet Device Manager</wintitle>. In addition
to devices and proxy points, this component contains the station’s
BACnet communications protocol stack (Bacnet Comm), and a Local Bacnet
Device, which configures the station’s representation as a BACnet
device.</shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "><indexterm class="- topic/indexterm ">BacnetNetwork</indexterm></keywords></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section "><p class="- topic/p ">The driver supports only one BACnet network component
in a station regardless of how many different BACnet link-layer protocols
are being used.</p><fig class="- topic/fig "><title class="- topic/title ">BacnetNetwork properties</title><image placement="break" scale="65" width="700" href="../graphic/BacnetNetworkPropertySheet_0000053629.png" class="- topic/image "/></fig><p class="- topic/p ">To access these properties, expand <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Config</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Drivers</uicontrol></menucascade>, right-click <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">BacnetNetwork</uicontrol> and click <menucascade class="+ topic/ph ui-d/menucascade "><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Views</uicontrol><uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Property Sheet</uicontrol></menucascade>.</p><p class="- topic/p ">In addition
to the common properties (Status, Enabled, Health and Fault Cause),
this component has these properties.</p></section><properties class="- topic/simpletable reference/properties "><prophead class="- topic/sthead      reference/prophead "><proptypehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptypehd ">Property</proptypehd><propvaluehd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvaluehd ">Value</propvaluehd><propdeschd class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdeschd ">Description</propdeschd></prophead><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Alarm Source Info</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc ">Contains a set of properties for configuring and routing alarms when this component is the alarm source. </propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Monitor</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">ping monitor</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/gen_Monitor-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">History Policies</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetHistoryPolicies-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Bacnet Comm</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetBacnetComm-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Local Device</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/WH-guide-BACnet.dita#WH-guide-BACnet-0ED816BF/bacnetLocalDevice-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property><property class="- topic/strow       reference/property "><proptype class="- topic/stentry     reference/proptype ">Tuning Policies</proptype><propvalue class="- topic/stentry     reference/propvalue ">additional properties</propvalue><propdesc class="- topic/stentry     reference/propdesc "><div conref="../reuse/Reuse1.dita#Reuse1-CAD76CAC/gen_TuningPolicy-div" class="- topic/div "/></propdesc></property></properties></refbody></reference>